\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Welcome to my personal website! I am full professor at the Department of Business analytics and decisions sciences (BADS) at WU Wien. I  develop mathematical theory and practical algorithms for optimization, game theory, machine learning, engineering, and societal challenges.\
